   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southesat Asian Press Alliance, SEAPA, is a press freedom organisation in Bangkok. Sida has supported SEAPA since 2004 through the global freedom of expression network IFEX. This direct support to SEAPA will mainly be used for press freedom monitoring, advocacy and campaigning activities, dissemination of information about Southeast Asia globally, as well as continued internal capacity strengthening.</narrative>
